stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Dragging: drag pasteboard changed and mouse dragged
  Dragging --> Idle: mouse up (normal drop)
  Dragging --> WheelOpen: modifier tapped
  state WheelOpen {
    [*] --> Conversions
    Conversions --> Tools: ⌘
    Conversions --> Actions: ⌃
    Tools --> Conversions: ⇧
    Tools --> Actions: ⌃
    Actions --> Conversions: ⇧
    Actions --> Tools: ⌘
  }
  WheelOpen --> Highlighted: pointer enters petal
  Highlighted --> WheelOpen: pointer leaves petal
  Highlighted --> Executing: drop on petal
  WheelOpen --> Idle: drop elsewhere / Esc / drag cancelled
  Executing --> ToolWindow: tool needs settings
  ToolWindow --> Executing: Apply
  ToolWindow --> Idle: Cancel
  Executing --> Done: success
  Executing --> Failed: error
  Done --> Idle
  Failed --> Idle
